### Everything goes through the gateway on port 8080.
### Needs all 4 services running + MongoDB (docker compose up -d).

@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Browse coupons - public, no token -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/coupons

### 2. Log in as a normal user (register first via auth-service/requests.http if needed)
# @name user
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "asha@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Log in as admin (password is ADMIN_PASSWORD in your .env file)
# @name admin
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@deals.local",
  "password": "PASTE_ADMIN_PASSWORD_FROM_.env"
}

### 4. Create a coupon with NO token -> 401 (who are you?)
POST {{gateway}}/api/coupons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "GATE10", "provider": "Ajio", "category": "Fashion", "discount": 10, "expiryDate": "2027-12-31" }

### 5. Create a coupon as a USER -> 403 (I know you, but you're not allowed)
POST {{gateway}}/api/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{user.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "GATE10", "provider": "Ajio", "category": "Fashion", "discount": 10, "expiryDate": "2027-12-31" }

### 6. Create a coupon as ADMIN -> 201
# @name coupon
POST {{gateway}}/api/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "GATE10", "provider": "Ajio", "category": "Fashion", "discount": 10, "expiryDate": "2027-12-31" }

### 7. User saves that coupon (gateway -> user-service -> coupon-service) -> 201
POST {{gateway}}/api/users/me/saved-coupons/{{coupon.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user.response.body.token}}

### 8. User's saved coupons -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/me/saved-coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{user.response.body.token}}

### 9. Who am I? (routed to auth-service) -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{user.response.body.token}}

### 10. Admin deletes the coupon -> 204
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/coupons/{{coupon.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
